{"abstract":"Notice is hereby given of the following determinations: I hereby determine that certain objects being imported from abroad pursuant to agreements with their foreign owners or custodians for temporary display in the exhibition \"Once Upon a Roof: Vanished Korean Architecture\" at the Arthur M. Sackler Gallery, Smithsonian Institution, Washington, District of Columbia, and at possible additional exhibitions or venues yet to be determined, are of cultural significance, and, further, that their temporary exhibition or display within the United States as aforementioned is in the national interest. I have ordered that Public Notice of these determinations be published in the Federal Register.","action":null,"agencies":[{"id":476,"json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/agencies/476","name":"State Department","parent_id":null,"raw_name":"DEPARTMENT OF STATE","slug":"state-department","url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/agencies/state-department"}],"body_html_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/html/2022/04/01/2022-06858.html","cfr_references":[],"citation":"87 FR 19167","comment_url":null,"comments_close_on":null,"correction_of":null,"corrections":[],"dates":null,"disposition_notes":null,"docket_ids":["Public Notice: 11696"],"dockets":[],"document_number":"2022-06858","effective_on":null,"end_page":19168,"executive_order_notes":null,"executive_order_number":null,"full_text_xml_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/xml/2022/04/01/2022-06858.xml","html_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2022/04/01/2022-06858/notice-of-determinations-culturally-significant-objects-being-imported-for-exhibition-determinations","images":{},"images_metadata":{},"json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/documents/2022-06858?publication_date=2022-04-01","mods_url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/metadata/granule/FR-2022-04-01/2022-06858/mods.xml","not_received_for_publication":null,"page_length":2,"page_views":{"count":45,"last_updated":"2026-10-23 08:15:04 -0400"},"pdf_url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2022-04-01/pdf/2022-06858.pdf","presidential_document_number":null,"proclamation_number":null,"public_inspection_pdf_url":"https://public-inspection.federalregister.gov/2022-06858.pdf?1648730720","publication_date":"2022-04-01","raw_text_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/text/2022/04/01/2022-06858.txt","regulation_id_number_info":{},"regulation_id_numbers":[],"regulations_dot_gov_info":{"agency_id":"DOS","checked_regulationsdotgov_at":"2022-04-02T03:30:07Z","comments_count":0,"comments_url":"https://www.regulations.gov/docketBrowser?rpp=50&so=DESC&sb=postedDate&po=0&dct=PS&D=DOS_FRDOC_0001","docket_id":"DOS_FRDOC_0001","document_id":"DOS_FRDOC_0001-5799","regulation_id_number":null,"supporting_documents":[],"supporting_documents_count":0,"title":"National Security Information Regulations"},"regulations_dot_gov_url":null,"significant":null,"signing_date":null,"start_page":19167,"subtype":null,"title":"Notice of Determinations; Culturally Significant Objects Being Imported for Exhibition-Determinations: “Once Upon a Roof: Vanished Korean Architecture” Exhibition","toc_doc":"Once Upon a Roof: Vanished Korean Architecture","toc_subject":"Culturally Significant Objects Imported for Exhibition:\n","topics":[],"type":"Notice","volume":87}